  data:
    Id: rampage
    DisplayName: Rampage
    Description: He stops picking targets. Seventy percent of a Slam, thrown at everything
      standing. Below 50 Fury it lands as a normal sweep; at 50 or more it spends
      half his Fury for double damage; at 100 it spends it all for quadruple. He
      always throws the hardest sweep he can afford.
